	<section_number>63.2-1519</section_number>
	<catch_line>Physician-patient and spousal privileges inapplicable</catch_line>
	<text>
		In any legal proceeding resulting from the filing of any report or complaint pursuant to this chapter, the physician-patient and spousal privileges shall not apply.
	</text>
	<history>1975, c. 341, § 63.1-248.11; 2002, c. 747; 2020, c. 900.</history>
